1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,120
Master,

25
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,720
since someone is ahead of us,

26
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,360
let's just follow them !

27
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:00,040
It'll save us some effort.

28
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,120
It's too quiet.

29
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,160
Hurry up, Master.

30
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:19,000
They paved a way for us,

31
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,320
it's a great opportunity.

32
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,600
As expected,

33
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,840
the restriction still exists.

34
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,760
What are you doing !?

35
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,720
You wouldn't...

36
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,640
We have no choice but to fight.

37
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:55,160
Underlings, attack them !

38
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,240
No way...

39
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:19,160
Master... Master...

40
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:22,120
This thing is too powerful,

41
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:24,120
I've done my best...

42
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:37,440
If I try to use brute force with my Core Formation cultivation,

43
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,840
I'll die for sure.

44
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:43,840
Master,

45
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,320
how do we break this thing ?

46
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:47,160
I don't know.

47
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,640
What's so great about you ?

48
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,600
"I don't know"

49
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:54,160
All restrictions must have a core.

50
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:57,640
If there's a core, it can be broken.

51
00:03:58,480 --> 00:04:00,320
This restriction is extremely complex,

52
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:02,040
it was clearly set up by an expert.

53
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:04,360
I can only try to unravel it bit by bit.

54
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:11,040
Why are we studying now ?

55
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:32,600
Master,

56
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:35,560
it's been 10 days... 10 days !

57
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:38,360
What are you doing exactly !?

58
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:41,240
I did it.

59
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:45,640
Here.

60
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:48,160
This is the core of the restriction.

61
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,560
Wait...

62
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:50,440
This is...

63
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,640
fear ?

64
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:53,920
Fear

65
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:56,880
Fear !

66
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:01,080
A fear aura ?

67
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:02,480
Master,

68
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:05,320
the person ahead of us is the Six Desires Devil Lord.

69
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,760
Well played...

70
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:10,680
He overlayed a fear aura over the original restriction.

71
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,560
No wonder it was so strong.

72
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,960
Using spiritual energy to break restrictions

73
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,440
is too slow.

74
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,160
Maybe if I could attack them with Divine Sense...

75
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,080
Master,

76
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,960
what should we do now ?

77
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,600
Don't panic,

78
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,600
I'm not worried about him being ahead

79
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:31,920
but of someone catching up from behind.

80
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:32,680
Right !

81
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:36,000
Either that old ghost dies ahead

82
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,360
or clears the path for us.

83
00:05:38,640 --> 00:05:40,520
But since you broke his restriction,

84
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:43,880
won't that old ghost notice

85
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,720
that we're following him ?

86
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:49,040
He will definitely notice

87
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:52,200
but he might not guess that it's me.

88
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,440
The restriction has been broken.

89
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:11,280
I wonder if it's that old ghost Duanmu or Hunchback Meng.

90
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:13,160
It doesn't matter,

91
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:16,360
I have studied restrictions for 1000 years.

92
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:19,640
I'll properly prepare the road for you.

93
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:30,400
7 years later

94
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:34,760
You damn fiend !

95
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:37,440
He keeps using me to test the restrictions !

96
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,160
I've served you well !

97
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,240
I've shed blood for you !

98
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:42,160
You can't treat me like this !

99
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:47,080
These restriction cores are made with Divine Sense.

100
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:50,200
If only I could use my Divine Sense to destroy them.

101
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,600
Master, what did you do !?

102
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,160
Help me !

103
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:14,160
Attacking it with Divine Sense triggers the restriction.

104
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,760
What happens if I cover the core

105
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:18,040
with my Divine Sense.

106
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:43,880
Go !

107
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:54,040
Using Divine Sense to break restrictions

108
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:56,120
is much more effective than spiritual energy.

109
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,040
Master, congratulations

110
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:19,240
on mastering Divine Sense restriction attacks.

111
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:21,400
We'll easily beat this second trial !

112
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:24,960
A few months later

113
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:34,160
My understanding of restrictions has tremendously improved.

114
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:36,760
Everything the Six Desires Devil Lord can do,

115
00:08:36,760 --> 00:08:39,480
I, Wang Lin, can also do now.

116
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:51,320
Although the first trial took some time,

117
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:54,720
I've been able to preserve

118
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,360
most of my artifacts.

119
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,440
Evil-Subduing Demonic Fire !

120
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:38,160
I hate these convoluted restrictions the most.

121
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:41,400
I already passed this trial 1000 years ago.

122
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:44,560
This second trial won't stop me.

123
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:09,800
Who is it ?

124
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,200
How are they going so fast ?

125
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,520
He's using brute force to break the restrictions.

126
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,160
It can only be Duanmu Ji.

127
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,760
Then aren't we doomed ?

128
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,840
We can't go forward nor backwards.

129
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,360
No matter what we do, we're dead !

130
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:23,240
We must delay him as much as possible.
